D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]bead commits survive workspace preparation, the ACE Plans tab [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]resolves and commits bead state correctly on migrated projects, and[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]epic sase-a8 is closed with its plan file marked done.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]land_beads_sidecar_epic.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Restore unpushed bead-commit protection for root-layout stores[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]prepare[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]prepare: teach the workspace-preparation preflight that a repository can[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]itself be the bead store, so local-only bead commits in the dedicated [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]beads clone are published or rescued before a clean and hard checkout [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]discards them.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop a README-only plans subdirectory from shadowing a flat [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]plans root[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]flatroot[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]flatroot: require a nested plans directory to hold month directories [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]before it disqualifies a flat plans sidecar root, so plan search and SDD[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]file listing stop returning nothing for a plans clone that carries a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]generated directory README.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Resolve the ACE Plans tab's plans root through the store[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]plansroot[dim] · [dim][/dim]after flatroot[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plansroot: resolve each project's plans root through the SDD store [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]instead of walking up from the bead directory, so linked plan documents,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cache keys, and the archive search all target the real plans clone.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Commit ACE scoped bead edits against the bead store's own [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]repository[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]acecommit[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]acecommit: resolve the owning git root from the bead directory instead [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of assuming its parent, so bead updates submitted from the Plans tab are[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]actually committed and pushed rather than silently dropped.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Close the epic, sweep symbols, and mark the plan done[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]land[dim] · [dim][/dim]after prepare, flatroot, plansroot, acecommit[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]land: re-verify the split end to end, close bead sase-a8 without [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]forcing, clear whatever symvision reports once the epic whitelist [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]expires, and mark both plan files done.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ab","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-ab.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-84c98646e02f55f0dadffe0bc0dc29e8","started_at":"2026-07-28T11:39:47.471075+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785239764,"sha":"8137b10480ef0e1c03613c3cad862f707e56d95d","subject":"fix: preserve flat plans sidecar with plans README (sase-ab.2)"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"beb77eee2478119baa9a813535bcf3d544e147677b602d99ea1ec76bd4c87199","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ab.2/commits.json","size_bytes":240},"embedded_wo